1
00:00:02,461 --> 00:00:03,712
<i>Elloran citizens,</i>

2
00:00:03,837 --> 00:00:05,964
<i>the Council asks
for your cooperation</i>

3
00:00:06,089 --> 00:00:08,341
<i>as we continue our hunt
for the Avatar.</i>

4
00:00:08,342 --> 00:00:10,510
Listen to me, Pavi,
I can explain.

5
00:00:10,511 --> 00:00:12,386
I know what you did, traitor!

6
00:00:12,387 --> 00:00:16,265
<i>Do you think maybe we can
finally find Mom and Dad?</i>

7
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:19,603
<i>There's nothing here
but ghosts.</i>

8
00:00:20,687 --> 00:00:21,897
You're a spirit.

9
00:00:22,439 --> 00:00:24,066
<i>Why did you bring me here?</i>

10
00:00:27,402 --> 00:00:29,612
Oh... it can't be true.

11
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:33,074
<i>I'm done
chasing the past.</i>

12
00:00:33,075 --> 00:00:36,869
<i>From now on, the only thing
I care about is you and me.</i>

13
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:39,206
Why, hello again, young Avatar!

14
00:00:41,959 --> 00:00:43,417
<i>Fire.</i>

15
00:00:43,418 --> 00:00:45,002
<i>Air.</i>

16
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:46,337
<i>Water.</i>

17
00:00:46,338 --> 00:00:47,339
<i>Earth.</i>

18
00:00:48,882 --> 00:00:50,801
<i>Long ago, the Avatar,</i>

19
00:00:50,926 --> 00:00:53,010
<i>master of all four elements,</i>

20
00:00:53,011 --> 00:00:55,596
<i>brought forth the Cataclysm.</i>

21
00:00:55,597 --> 00:00:57,139
<i>Out of the devastation,</i>

22
00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:59,976
<i>the world built
the Seven Havens.</i>

23
00:00:59,977 --> 00:01:01,937
<i>Now the Avatar has returned,</i>

24
00:01:02,062 --> 00:01:05,022
<i>but for the first time,
there are two.</i>

25
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:07,859
<i>Most fear they'll destroy
the world again...</i>

26
00:01:07,985 --> 00:01:09,278
<i>But I believe...</i>

27
00:01:09,695 --> 00:01:10,987
<i>they will save it.</i>

28
00:01:18,662 --> 00:01:20,455
Pick it up!
The caravan needs to be

29
00:01:20,581 --> 00:01:22,207
on the move before dawn!

30
00:01:22,332 --> 00:01:25,293
Tighten those ropes!
No sloppy knots!

31
00:01:25,294 --> 00:01:26,877
I'm looking at you, Kosal.

32
00:01:26,878 --> 00:01:28,714
You're not the boss of me.

33
00:01:28,839 --> 00:01:30,464
But we sure fooled
those Ellorans

34
00:01:30,465 --> 00:01:33,551
into thinking you were,
Queen Zi!

35
00:01:35,095 --> 00:01:37,848
I wouldn't follow Zi
into a lunch line!

36
00:02:01,163 --> 00:02:03,165
They don't hate me?

37
00:02:04,166 --> 00:02:07,878
The Avatar and the Faceless
have a lot in common.

38
00:02:08,002 --> 00:02:10,672
We're feared because people
don't understand us,

39
00:02:10,797 --> 00:02:13,174
and can't control us.

40
00:02:13,175 --> 00:02:13,925
Wait.

41
00:02:14,051 --> 00:02:16,053
We're not your prisoners?

42
00:02:17,429 --> 00:02:18,430
Why would I imprison

43
00:02:18,555 --> 00:02:21,266
my favorite
least-paying customer?

44
00:02:21,725 --> 00:02:23,601
You've been liberated
from a haven

45
00:02:23,602 --> 00:02:25,770
that despises the Avatar.

46
00:02:25,771 --> 00:02:28,190
Why not come with us
to the Republic Forest?

47
00:02:28,315 --> 00:02:31,068
You'd finally be accepted
for who you really are.

48
00:02:31,193 --> 00:02:33,945
Leave Ellora? But it's our home!

49
00:02:34,613 --> 00:02:35,822
At least...

50
00:02:36,448 --> 00:02:37,532
it was.

51
00:02:38,909 --> 00:02:40,369
Do you want to go?

52
00:02:41,370 --> 00:02:44,873
It would be nice not to hide
all the time.

53
00:02:44,998 --> 00:02:46,290
But if we leave,

54
00:02:46,291 --> 00:02:49,169
I'll never see Luster
or Mica again...

55
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:51,170
or Jae.

56
00:02:51,171 --> 00:02:53,256
Jae is a rotten liar.

57
00:02:53,632 --> 00:02:56,301
And I bet they have plenty
of rocks in the Republic Forest.

58
00:02:56,843 --> 00:02:58,928
What if they don't get
my sense of humor?

59
00:02:58,929 --> 00:03:00,806
If you don't wanna go, we won't.

60
00:03:00,931 --> 00:03:03,725
As long as we're together,
I don't care where we are.

61
00:03:04,810 --> 00:03:05,769
Me neither.

62
00:03:05,894 --> 00:03:07,562
I go where you go, sis.

63
00:03:07,688 --> 00:03:09,188
Twin promise?

64
00:03:09,189 --> 00:03:10,524
Twin promise.

65
00:03:11,483 --> 00:03:14,443
Agam... we accept
your invitation.

66
00:03:17,239 --> 00:03:20,533
I wanna see fire,
water, earth, wind!

67
00:03:20,534 --> 00:03:22,828
Ooh! Can you do them all
at the same time?

68
00:03:23,286 --> 00:03:26,288
Listen up!
I'm the Avatar's sister,

69
00:03:26,289 --> 00:03:30,001
and you just bought tickets
to The Nisha Show!

70
00:03:30,127 --> 00:03:32,003
So tighten your pants!

71
00:03:32,129 --> 00:03:34,922
All right, sis! Let 'er rip!

72
00:03:34,923 --> 00:03:38,259
Avatar! Avatar!

73
00:03:38,260 --> 00:03:39,720
Avatar!

74
00:03:39,845 --> 00:03:41,304
Avatar!

75
00:03:44,766 --> 00:03:45,809
<i>Mom! Dad!</i>

76
00:03:50,272 --> 00:03:51,273
Uh...

77
00:03:51,690 --> 00:03:52,857
What happened?

78
00:03:52,858 --> 00:03:54,192
Nisha, what's wrong?

79
00:03:55,944 --> 00:03:58,238
That's all
the Avatar's got?

80
00:03:59,364 --> 00:04:02,743
My bending... It-It's gone!

81
00:04:02,868 --> 00:04:05,287
- Oh!
- That's not good.

82
00:04:06,496 --> 00:04:07,456
My Queen,

83
00:04:07,581 --> 00:04:09,624
we're taking on the burden
of the Avatar

84
00:04:09,750 --> 00:04:11,333
and she can't even bend?

85
00:04:11,334 --> 00:04:13,712
Kayoko will never stop
hunting her.

86
00:04:13,837 --> 00:04:16,130
It's not worth risking
our necks.

87
00:04:17,841 --> 00:04:18,715
No way!

88
00:04:18,716 --> 00:04:20,217
Get out of here!

89
00:04:21,136 --> 00:04:22,846
Calm down, friends!

90
00:04:22,971 --> 00:04:25,307
I'm sure
whatever ails the Avatar

91
00:04:25,432 --> 00:04:29,102
can be fixed
with a spiritual alignment.

92
00:04:29,603 --> 00:04:31,021
And if it doesn't work?

93
00:04:31,521 --> 00:04:34,149
Well... let's hope it does.

94
00:04:48,663 --> 00:04:50,999
What are they up to?

95
00:04:58,298 --> 00:05:00,467
Commander,
your girlfriend's here.

96
00:05:00,592 --> 00:05:03,303
Kayoko. Joining us for dinner?

97
00:05:03,428 --> 00:05:05,222
What do you think
of our new prison?

98
00:05:05,347 --> 00:05:08,474
Strong enough to hold
even the Human Hurricane.

99
00:05:08,475 --> 00:05:10,936
If you would just
let me explain.

100
00:05:11,436 --> 00:05:13,772
I'm not interested
in any more lies.

101
00:05:13,897 --> 00:05:16,065
Datu, we'll need to prepare
several more

102
00:05:16,066 --> 00:05:17,484
of these overflow chambers.

103
00:05:17,901 --> 00:05:20,945
You've captured
all the White Lotus in Ellora.

104
00:05:20,946 --> 00:05:23,197
There's no need
to imprison anyone else.

105
00:05:23,198 --> 00:05:26,952
I don't care
about your cult, Commander.

106
00:05:27,077 --> 00:05:28,787
We've located your Avatar.

107
00:05:28,912 --> 00:05:30,538
She's hiding
in the Old World ruins

108
00:05:30,539 --> 00:05:31,706
with the Faceless.

109
00:05:32,374 --> 00:05:34,959
With our newfound knowledge
of the spirit energy,

110
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:38,463
we can strike two rattle-ravens
with one arrow.

111
00:05:38,588 --> 00:05:40,381
Kayoko, please don't tell me

112
00:05:40,382 --> 00:05:42,299
you're meddling
with that dangerous energy!

113
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:45,636
Oh, of course
you'd react like this!

114
00:05:45,637 --> 00:05:47,304
You hid this secret power
from me

115
00:05:47,305 --> 00:05:49,890
so you and the Avatar
could destroy Ellora!

116
00:05:49,891 --> 00:05:53,854
Instead, I'll use the Avatar's
own weapon against her!

117
00:05:54,479 --> 00:05:55,981
This isn't the way!

118
00:05:56,106 --> 00:05:58,066
Please!

119
00:06:06,241 --> 00:06:08,660
Such magnificent power...

120
00:06:09,077 --> 00:06:12,205
Ellora will never be
vulnerable again.

121
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:14,456
Now, what have you learned?

122
00:06:14,457 --> 00:06:15,834
If our calculations are correct,

123
00:06:16,334 --> 00:06:18,252
and I can't emphasize enough,

124
00:06:18,253 --> 00:06:20,046
this is not our field,

125
00:06:20,171 --> 00:06:23,049
the spirit energy will breach
the reservoir within a week!

126
00:06:23,174 --> 00:06:25,594
You confirmed the layout
of the tunnels?

127
00:06:26,928 --> 00:06:29,180
We are here
in the reservoir,

128
00:06:29,306 --> 00:06:31,391
the White Lotus
are being held here

129
00:06:31,516 --> 00:06:33,059
in the overflow chamber,

130
00:06:33,184 --> 00:06:35,519
and this tunnel runs
towards the ruins.

131
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:37,855
Can we divert the energy there?

132
00:06:37,856 --> 00:06:39,064
In theory.

133
00:06:39,065 --> 00:06:41,108
But the facility
is in disrepair.

134
00:06:41,109 --> 00:06:43,027
A physical catalyst
would be needed

135
00:06:43,028 --> 00:06:44,653
to make the energy levels rise.

136
00:06:44,654 --> 00:06:47,907
That should be enough to push it
into the adjoining tunnel.

137
00:06:47,908 --> 00:06:49,659
What sort of catalyst?

138
00:06:49,784 --> 00:06:51,328
I'm not sure.

139
00:06:51,703 --> 00:06:53,371
We do know
that the spirit energy

140
00:06:53,496 --> 00:06:55,998
becomes more volatile
in the presence of fear.

141
00:06:55,999 --> 00:06:59,210
But no sane mind would consider
poking this bear further.

142
00:06:59,336 --> 00:07:01,379
Diverting the energy
is far too dangerous--

143
00:07:01,504 --> 00:07:02,671
Enough!

144
00:07:02,672 --> 00:07:05,383
Hey, Chancellor, please!

145
00:07:05,842 --> 00:07:07,802
This is terrifying!

146
00:07:07,928 --> 00:07:09,304
Good.

147
00:07:09,429 --> 00:07:11,806
Thank you
for your sacrifice, Doctor.

148
00:07:12,349 --> 00:07:14,517
For the survival of Ellora.

149
00:07:33,954 --> 00:07:36,206
Chancellor, you had no right!

150
00:07:36,331 --> 00:07:38,625
Would you like
to join your colleague?

151
00:07:39,084 --> 00:07:40,168
Uh...

152
00:07:50,512 --> 00:07:52,888
There's one more hatch
that needs to be opened

153
00:07:52,889 --> 00:07:55,058
for the energy
to reach the ruins.

154
00:07:55,475 --> 00:07:58,311
Prepare the guards
and Brigade to raid the ruins.

155
00:07:58,728 --> 00:08:00,480
Wait for my signal.

156
00:08:01,439 --> 00:08:03,692
Have you heard
from Commander Jae?

157
00:08:04,109 --> 00:08:06,902
No. Need me to track him down?

158
00:08:06,903 --> 00:08:09,531
Not yet.
I'm not sure if his loyalties

159
00:08:09,656 --> 00:08:11,366
still lie with Karthik.

160
00:08:30,343 --> 00:08:31,219
Hmm.

161
00:08:31,344 --> 00:08:33,012
What's wrong with Nisha?

162
00:08:33,013 --> 00:08:35,139
Why is her bending all...

163
00:08:35,140 --> 00:08:37,766
bent out of shape?

164
00:08:37,767 --> 00:08:41,979
My, my! You're overflowing
with energy.

165
00:08:41,980 --> 00:08:44,732
Never felt that before.
But then again,

166
00:08:44,733 --> 00:08:48,152
I've never tried to read
an Avatar's chakras until now.

167
00:08:48,153 --> 00:08:49,404
Chakras?

168
00:08:49,529 --> 00:08:52,906
Think of them as focus points
of our inner energy.

169
00:08:52,907 --> 00:08:54,576
When a chakra is blocked,

170
00:08:54,701 --> 00:08:57,579
it can disrupt
our energy's natural flow.

171
00:08:57,704 --> 00:09:01,750
Bad for your spirit
and your bending.

172
00:09:01,875 --> 00:09:04,919
Same goes for you,
my little trash gremlin.

173
00:09:05,045 --> 00:09:06,379
You knew I could bend?

174
00:09:06,504 --> 00:09:08,422
First time you came by my shop.

175
00:09:08,423 --> 00:09:10,050
Your stance gave it away.

176
00:09:10,175 --> 00:09:12,427
Strength recognizes strength.

177
00:09:22,812 --> 00:09:26,024
The seven chakras
run up the body.

178
00:09:26,149 --> 00:09:28,025
Each has a different nature.

179
00:09:28,026 --> 00:09:29,943
I saw these symbols

180
00:09:29,944 --> 00:09:32,363
when I got zapped
by the Anomaly!

181
00:09:35,784 --> 00:09:37,076
Oh, gremlin.

182
00:09:37,077 --> 00:09:38,953
Your chakras are a mess.

183
00:09:39,079 --> 00:09:40,914
Are you able to bend?

184
00:09:49,380 --> 00:09:51,673
Cute. But imagine
what you can do

185
00:09:51,674 --> 00:09:54,052
once your chakras are unblocked.

186
00:09:54,177 --> 00:09:55,553
How do I do that?

187
00:09:55,678 --> 00:09:57,012
Your first chakra

188
00:09:57,013 --> 00:09:58,889
is the Root Chakra,

189
00:09:58,890 --> 00:10:02,519
which deals with fear
and survival.

190
00:10:02,644 --> 00:10:03,936
What scares you?

191
00:10:03,937 --> 00:10:06,396
I'm nine and hunted
by the government.

192
00:10:06,397 --> 00:10:08,983
I'm scared of everything
all the time!

193
00:10:09,484 --> 00:10:10,568
Fair.

194
00:10:11,444 --> 00:10:14,071
You weren't being
serious before, right?

195
00:10:14,072 --> 00:10:16,449
I mean, even if my bending
doesn't come back,

196
00:10:16,574 --> 00:10:18,951
we can still come with you,
can't we?

197
00:10:18,952 --> 00:10:20,536
Sorry, kid.

198
00:10:20,537 --> 00:10:22,663
I empathize with your plight,

199
00:10:22,664 --> 00:10:25,791
but I have to put
my people first.

200
00:10:25,792 --> 00:10:26,960
With you along,

201
00:10:27,085 --> 00:10:30,003
we'll be a target for Kayoko
and other havens.

202
00:10:30,004 --> 00:10:31,713
If you can't bend,

203
00:10:31,714 --> 00:10:33,674
you won't be able to join us.

204
00:10:36,094 --> 00:10:38,554
I've seen how powerful you are.

205
00:10:38,555 --> 00:10:39,681
Don't overthink it.

206
00:10:39,806 --> 00:10:43,810
Just do what you were born
to do, Avatar.

207
00:10:46,229 --> 00:10:47,771
Hmm. Kinda funny...

208
00:10:47,772 --> 00:10:51,066
Ellora didn't want you
<i>because</i> you're the Avatar,

209
00:10:51,067 --> 00:10:52,651
and now the Faceless
won't take us

210
00:10:52,652 --> 00:10:54,612
'cause you <i>can't</i> be the Avatar.

211
00:10:55,071 --> 00:10:58,241
But you can!

212
00:10:58,658 --> 00:11:01,368
Wait. Are you saying
what I think you're saying?

213
00:11:01,369 --> 00:11:04,955
If you show the Faceless
you're also an Avatar,

214
00:11:04,956 --> 00:11:06,541
they'll let us go with them!

215
00:11:06,666 --> 00:11:09,502
But... then everyone
will know about me.

216
00:11:09,961 --> 00:11:13,463
So? You've seen me deal with
all the stares and shouting.

217
00:11:13,464 --> 00:11:15,508
You can handle it!

218
00:11:16,634 --> 00:11:18,385
Mm! Better idea!

219
00:11:18,386 --> 00:11:20,388
I help you get
your bending back.

220
00:11:20,513 --> 00:11:23,558
That way you stay
the one and only Avatar.

221
00:11:23,683 --> 00:11:26,561
So, let's figure out
why you're blocked.

222
00:11:26,686 --> 00:11:27,937
What are you scared of?

223
00:11:28,354 --> 00:11:30,231
- Uh...
<i>- Mom! Dad!</i>

224
00:11:32,025 --> 00:11:33,776
Nothing! Nothing at all!

225
00:11:34,152 --> 00:11:35,653
My heart is like a diamond.

226
00:11:36,321 --> 00:11:37,530
Or a bear.

227
00:11:38,072 --> 00:11:39,157
A diamond bear.

228
00:11:39,866 --> 00:11:41,325
If you're not scared,

229
00:11:41,326 --> 00:11:43,535
maybe you just need to relax.

230
00:11:43,536 --> 00:11:45,163
I have an idea. Come on!

231
00:11:48,625 --> 00:11:51,251
Still no sign of Commander Jae.

232
00:11:51,252 --> 00:11:52,502
He'll miss all the glory!

233
00:11:52,503 --> 00:11:54,672
He'll answer for his absence.

234
00:11:54,797 --> 00:11:56,758
After our victory.

235
00:12:04,349 --> 00:12:06,559
Welcome to Spa Pavi!

236
00:12:06,935 --> 00:12:08,978
Why'd I let you talk me
into this?

237
00:12:09,103 --> 00:12:10,605
You love baths!

238
00:12:10,730 --> 00:12:13,357
I'm against them. Dirt protects
you from the world.

239
00:12:13,358 --> 00:12:16,778
But I bet this will relax
your bending back into shape.

240
00:12:17,153 --> 00:12:19,071
Too hot!

241
00:12:20,657 --> 00:12:24,035
Too c-c-cold! Too cold!
Too cold! Too cold!

242
00:12:29,123 --> 00:12:31,291
Just relax.

243
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:01,489
Stop! This isn't helping!

244
00:13:01,614 --> 00:13:04,157
I don't care
if my bending comes back!

245
00:13:04,158 --> 00:13:06,160
I don't wanna be the Avatar!

246
00:13:14,919 --> 00:13:17,505
Unleash the energy.

247
00:13:34,063 --> 00:13:36,024
Sorry I made things worse.

248
00:13:39,110 --> 00:13:40,987
You were just trying to help.

249
00:13:42,238 --> 00:13:45,616
You know how Agam asked me
what I'm afraid of?

250
00:13:45,742 --> 00:13:50,496
I am afraid of being seen
as... the Avatar.

251
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:53,958
That's why I wanted
your bending to come back.

252
00:13:54,625 --> 00:13:57,003
I should've told Agam
I'm an Avatar.

253
00:13:57,128 --> 00:13:59,505
I wish I was as brave as you.

254
00:13:59,922 --> 00:14:02,675
You... you think I'm brave?

255
00:14:03,217 --> 00:14:05,345
You're the bravest person
I know!

256
00:14:08,014 --> 00:14:09,849
Pavi, I lied!

257
00:14:10,641 --> 00:14:12,977
I didn't really lose my bending.

258
00:14:13,853 --> 00:14:15,104
I'm scared.

259
00:14:15,646 --> 00:14:18,482
What if I lose control and...

260
00:14:18,483 --> 00:14:20,568
and something bad happens?

261
00:14:21,819 --> 00:14:22,612
I just...

262
00:14:23,071 --> 00:14:26,407
I never want to lose you
because of something I did.

263
00:14:26,824 --> 00:14:29,743
Did you forget
about our Twin promise?

264
00:14:29,744 --> 00:14:31,578
No matter what you do,

265
00:14:31,579 --> 00:14:33,413
you're stuck with me, sis!

266
00:14:36,501 --> 00:14:39,253
Welcome back, Avatar!

267
00:14:41,047 --> 00:14:42,006
Finally!

268
00:14:42,507 --> 00:14:45,760
I've been looking
for you everywhere!

269
00:14:46,511 --> 00:14:48,012
Stay back, traitor!

270
00:14:52,850 --> 00:14:54,685
It's good
to see you too.

271
00:14:54,811 --> 00:14:56,562
Way to be a warrior, Geet.

272
00:14:56,687 --> 00:14:58,605
How did you find us?

273
00:14:58,606 --> 00:15:00,191
Kayoko knows you're here.

274
00:15:00,316 --> 00:15:02,317
She's gonna use
the spirit energy against you

275
00:15:02,318 --> 00:15:03,193
and the Faceless!

276
00:15:03,194 --> 00:15:04,195
Why would we believe

277
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,904
anything you say?

278
00:15:05,905 --> 00:15:08,407
You... You lied to us!

279
00:15:08,408 --> 00:15:10,200
And put Karthik in jail!

280
00:15:10,201 --> 00:15:13,246
If I hadn't arrested him,
I'd be in jail too.

281
00:15:13,371 --> 00:15:15,622
But instead,
I found out Kayoko's plan

282
00:15:15,623 --> 00:15:17,874
and now I know where
the White Lotus are being held!

283
00:15:17,875 --> 00:15:19,919
We can finally break them out.

284
00:15:20,336 --> 00:15:22,255
I took an oath
to protect you two,

285
00:15:22,755 --> 00:15:26,133
and even though you've made
my life way more complicated,

286
00:15:26,134 --> 00:15:28,343
I would never betray you.

287
00:15:28,344 --> 00:15:31,013
I will always be Team Avatar.

288
00:15:34,809 --> 00:15:35,935
Hmm.

289
00:15:36,394 --> 00:15:37,894
No red rash on his ears.

290
00:15:37,895 --> 00:15:39,605
He must be telling the truth!

291
00:15:41,107 --> 00:15:43,567
Okay. We believe you.

292
00:15:43,568 --> 00:15:45,361
Huh! Good!

293
00:15:45,778 --> 00:15:48,823
I was so scared
something happened to you two!

294
00:15:49,365 --> 00:15:51,784
We don't have much time.
We need to go, before--

295
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:08,592
Could the Avatar's powers
be coming back?

296
00:16:12,472 --> 00:16:14,432
That's not the Avatar.

297
00:16:20,771 --> 00:16:22,315
Get to high ground!

298
00:17:24,292 --> 00:17:26,337
The Avatar returns!

299
00:17:26,462 --> 00:17:28,338
What the heck
are you doing here?

300
00:17:28,339 --> 00:17:30,340
Don't worry, he's on our side!

301
00:17:30,341 --> 00:17:31,925
His ears proved it!

302
00:17:31,926 --> 00:17:33,970
It's a thing. Long story.

303
00:17:35,304 --> 00:17:37,390
Whoa! Thank you!

304
00:17:38,307 --> 00:17:40,100
Go help your people!

305
00:17:40,101 --> 00:17:41,769
Pavi and I can hold it back!

306
00:17:43,688 --> 00:17:46,357
I won't forget this, I promise.

307
00:18:00,496 --> 00:18:01,871
Long live the Faceless!

308
00:18:01,872 --> 00:18:03,666
We made it out!

309
00:18:06,877 --> 00:18:09,797
It's an ambush!

310
00:18:10,756 --> 00:18:12,424
You're done for, bandits!

311
00:18:21,350 --> 00:18:23,768
So this is what
you've become, Lan?

312
00:18:23,769 --> 00:18:25,646
A bully for a fearmonger?

313
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,982
Elloran scum!

314
00:18:28,399 --> 00:18:30,318
Ptoo!

315
00:18:30,901 --> 00:18:33,320
You traitors and thieves
can rot in jail

316
00:18:33,321 --> 00:18:35,531
while you rethink
your loyalties.

317
00:18:35,948 --> 00:18:37,950
Now, where's the Avatar?

318
00:18:42,747 --> 00:18:46,000
The Faceless are out!

319
00:18:46,125 --> 00:18:47,500
We need to go!

320
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,766
Jae!

321
00:19:19,867 --> 00:19:21,202
Keep going!

322
00:19:21,702 --> 00:19:23,412
Don't look back!

323
00:19:27,958 --> 00:19:29,251
Is that...

324
00:19:29,710 --> 00:19:31,212
Mom and Dad?

325
00:19:35,758 --> 00:19:37,759
We don't have time for this!

326
00:19:46,894 --> 00:19:49,230
Pavi! Nisha!

327
00:19:51,982 --> 00:19:53,567
Go! Save the girls!

328
00:20:34,859 --> 00:20:36,110
No.

329
00:20:36,736 --> 00:20:40,573
The Chancellor's fear
has driven her past reason.

330
00:20:40,698 --> 00:20:42,783
She is out of control.

331
00:20:44,034 --> 00:20:46,829
I have a plan to free
all your people and mine.

332
00:20:47,246 --> 00:20:48,789
But I need your help.

333
00:20:50,082 --> 00:20:52,626
Just tell me what to do.

334
00:20:53,919 --> 00:20:55,296
Chancellor!

335
00:20:55,963 --> 00:20:57,339
Commander Jae?

336
00:20:57,465 --> 00:20:58,758
Apologies, Chancellor.

337
00:20:59,175 --> 00:21:01,635
I had a hunch the Avatar
was hiding in the ruins.

338
00:21:01,761 --> 00:21:03,344
I wasn't able to find her.

339
00:21:03,345 --> 00:21:06,140
But I was able to capture
the Faceless Queen.

340
00:21:07,224 --> 00:21:09,226
I underestimated you, Commander.

341
00:21:09,643 --> 00:21:11,562
Now that we have
our benders back,

342
00:21:11,979 --> 00:21:14,982
Ellora will be ready
when the Avatar attacks.

343
00:21:15,107 --> 00:21:17,651
Take the prisoners home!

344
00:21:48,516 --> 00:21:50,309
Did we do this?

345
00:21:50,935 --> 00:21:53,853
No. The Avatar has retaliated.

